* 14 Sep 26 Windows port - RELEASE_1.1 5.  The pointer name is found in any
*           case, and a new pointer is written lower case.  The target file
*           name gains the downcase tier of the fold.
* 19 Aug 26 Windows port - SDSYS accounts, and the named account's voc, are
